ickpea mixture ahead of time and store it in an airtight container in the f=
ridge for up to 3 days. Assemble the sandwich on the morning of the day (or=
 days) you plan to eat it. Head to <a href=3D"https://www.loveandlemons.com=
/healthy-meal-prep-ideas/">this post</a> to find my best tips for prepping =
and packing sandwiches to take on the go!</p><p>This recipe is also wonderf=
ul picnic fare. Enjoy it on its own, or pair it with a fresh salad like my =
<a href=3D"https://www.loveandlemons.com/pasta-salad/">pasta salad</a>, <a =
